// Observables of the LOINC Ontology module without a LOINC code (1)
* $sct-loinc-ontology#364061000119103 "Presence of Streptococcus agalactiae in genital system by organism specific culture (observable entity)"
// The rule itself: intensional include, expandable only on a terminology server that
// holds the LOINC Ontology release named by the alias
* include codes from system $sct-loinc-ontology where constraint = "<< 363787002 |Observable entity (observable entity)| : 370130000 |Property (attribute)| = (118589004 |Threshold (property) (qualifier value)| OR 705057003 |Presence (property) (qualifier value)|), 246501002 |Technique (attribute)| = << 703725008 |Culture technique (qualifier value)|, (704319004 |Inheres in (attribute)| = << 410607006 |Organism (organism)| OR 246093002 |Component (attribute)| = << 410607006 |Organism (organism)|)"
